==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[urbanisation]]

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# an annoying essay subject
# the change in a [[country]] or [[region]] when its [[population]] [[migrate]]s from [[rural]] to [[urban]] areas
# the [[proportion]] of a region's population that live in [[town]]s and cities; the [[rate]] at which this proportion is growing

